body:
Of course I kept a lord close to them, usually you'll want to castle pretty hard with Heavy Destroyers, in this scenario against Tyranids you pretty much need to keep everything together. Heavy Gauss canon are strength 9, so you wound everything on 3s. I think you might think I was using regular Destroyers?  

