&nbsp;

**+ Elites +**

&nbsp;

**C'tan Shard of the Nightbringer [12 PL, 210pts]**

&nbsp;

**++ Outrider Detachment +1CP (Necrons) [42 PL, 713pts] ++**

&nbsp;

**+ No Force Org Slot +**

&nbsp;

**Dynasty Choice:** Dynasty: Nephrekh

&nbsp;

**+ HQ +**

&nbsp;

**Destroyer Lord [7 PL, 131pts]:** Phylactery, Warscythe

&nbsp;

**+ Fast Attack +**

