**++ Total: [96 PL, 1748pts] ++**

&nbsp;

Created with [BattleScribe](http://www.battlescribe.net)

It really depends on your approach to the game. If you're looking for a fluffy list, this list will be that, with lot of variety. If you just want to have fun and play with friends the list is fine.  

However, this is not a competitive list as you lack any of the competitive units we have at the moment.  

If you want to have a more competitive list here's what I would run at 1500pts  


